        // After the call completes (whether it reverted or not), the owner should remain unchanged for ALL inputs
        // in the correct contract. The mutant removes the onlyOwner check, allowing some non-owner caller to succeed
        // and potentially change ownership (via transferOwnership inside owned if present in variants), so the
